{"ref":"BDB, רַקָּה²","hw":"רַקָּה²","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">רַקָּה</span></big>  <strong>n.f. the temple</strong> (of the head): <a data-ref=\"Judges 4:21\" href=\"/Judges.4.21\">Ju 4:21</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">וַתִּתְקַע הַיָּתֵד בְרַקָּתוֹ</span>, v <a data-ref=\"Judges 4:22\" href=\"/Judges.4.22\">22</a> <a data-ref=\"Judges 5:26\" href=\"/Judges.5.26\">5:26</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">וּמָֽחְצָה וְחָֽלְפָה רַקָּתוֹ</span>, <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 4:3\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.4.3\">Ct 4:3</a> = <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 6:7\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.6.7\">6:7</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">כְּפֶלַח הָרִמּוֹן רַקָּתֵךְ</span>.","next":"BDB, רָקַק","prev":"BDB, רָקִיק"}